{
  "id": "E415",
  "title": "Strive For A Car",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-03-28",
  "synopsis": "Your boss works hard so he gets a new car. So, when you try hard…",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50415/d2073e49404367b172f31c11ddbd8a0241bf0014.mp3?1584960010",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "努力买新车\n\n小张：你看见了吗？老板又买新车了！\n小何：看见了。老板工作很努力，所以买新车了。\n小张：我也要努力，然后……\n小何：然后老板就能再买一辆了。\n",
    "traditional": "努力買新車\n\n小張：你看見了嗎？老闆又買新車了！\n小何：看見了。老闆工作很努力，所以買新車了。\n小張：我也要努力，然後……\n小何：然後老闆就能再買一輛了。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Strive to buy a new car"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：你看见了吗？老板又买新车了！",
      "traditional": "小張：你看見了嗎？老闆又買新車了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng nǐ kàn jiàn le ma lǎo bǎn yòu mǎi xīn chē le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Have you seen? The boss bought a new car again!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：看见了。老板工作很努力，所以买新车了。",
      "traditional": "小何：看見了。老闆工作很努力，所以買新車了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé kàn jiàn le lǎo bǎn gōng zuò hěn nǔ lì suǒ yǐ mǎi xīn chē le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Yes. The boss works very hard, so he bought a new car."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：我也要努力，然后……",
      "traditional": "小張：我也要努力，然後……",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ yě yào nǔ lì rán hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I will also work hard, and then…"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：然后老板就能再买一辆了。",
      "traditional": "小何：然後老闆就能再買一輛了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé rán hòu lǎo bǎn jiù néng zài mǎi yí liàng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Then the boss can buy another one."
    }
  ],
